      "title": "调制水淀粉",
      "instruction": "生粉倒入小碗中，加入 50ml 水，搅拌生粉直至融化没有颗粒",
      "duration_sec": 60,
      "tips": [
        "确保没有结块，否则勾芡不均匀"
      ],
      "produces": "水淀粉",
      "image": "https://cos.onmicrosoft.cn/cook/steps/other_gou-qian-xiang-gu-tang/step_2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "沥干水分",
      "instruction": "倒掉碗中的盐水，适当去掉香菇本身的水分",
      "duration_sec": 30,
      "tips": [
        "去除多余水分可以防止煎炸时溅油"
      ],
      "produces": "干香菇片",
      "image": "https://cos.onmicrosoft.cn/cook/steps/other_gou-qian-xiang-gu-tang/step_3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "煎炸香菇",
      "instruction": "小火倒入油，待油开始冒小泡，倒入香菇，每面煎 10s",
      "duration_sec": 60,
      "tips": [
        "此步骤为可选，煎过后汤头更香"
      ],
      "produces": "煎好的香菇",
      "image": "https://cos.onmicrosoft.cn/cook/steps/other_gou-qian-xiang-gu-tang/step_4.jpg"
